# === Signing keys and their passwords — NEVER committed (docs D-010) ===
# The release key of Read Files Tech lives OUTSIDE this repository. The Flutter clone keeps it under
# android/, ignored only by android/.gitignore: a merge that removes android/ removes that file too,
# and the key becomes committable there. This root file ignores every form of it from the first
# commit, whatever directory it lands in.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pfx
*.pem
key.properties
keystore.properties

# === Android local config ===
local.properties

